Template: guaranine/disk
Type: select
Choices: ${DISKS}
Description: Installation disk:
 ALL DATA ON THE SELECTED DISK WILL BE ERASED.
 Select the whole target disk. Disconnect other storage if uncertain.
 ${DETAILS}

Template: guaranine/confirm-disk
Type: string
Description: Confirm target disk:
 Type the exact disk path ${DISK} to confirm this installation target.
 Debian will also ask you to confirm writing the partition table.
